# Phase 04 — Members & UI kit

## Goal

Ship a shared UI kit and full member list/detail flows with validation and tests.

## Tasks

- Shared UI kit: theme, Button, Input, Card, StatusBadge, EmptyState, ErrorState, Loading, ConfirmDialog.
- Add / edit / view members.
- Search and filter; active / inactive status.
- Zod validation on member forms.
- Component and screen tests.

## Done when

- [ ] UI kit components exist and use shared theme tokens
- [ ] Members can be added, edited, and viewed
- [ ] Search, filter, and active/inactive work
- [ ] Zod validation covers forms
- [ ] Loading / empty / error / success states present
- [ ] Lint, typecheck, and tests pass

Update BUILD_STATUS.md, then stop and wait for me.
